msgctxt "264"
msgid "Whuh... Hooomph!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Looks like I won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Dang! Machine-gun quick as always! Guess I better up my\r\n"
"training, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Here's your prize money: 50,000 yen.\r\n"
"Now don't that feel special?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"Come challenge me again anytime. But next time you'll lose\r\n"
"for sure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "My win this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"...I gotta say, your performance today just didn't cut it. Find some better "
"footwork and come back. I'll be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Yaaaagh... Whew..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Looks like I won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"How... in the hell... is that possible? I always thought I was the fastest "
"fool around..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Well, here's your prize money: 70 big ones.\r\n"
"It's all there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "Guess I still got a ways to go... But I'll get you next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"What can I say? Ain't no one alive who can outrun this\r\n"
"custom-built running machine. And that's a known fact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"I was expecting a lot more from the man who beat my bro.\r\n"
"But, I guess that's that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"Do some legwork or something and come back later.\r\n"
"I'll be lacing up my shoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Khah... Fugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Looks like I win."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Now I see... how ya were able beat my brothers..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid ""
"Well, here's your prize money.\r\n"
"A sumptuous 100,000 yen.\r\n"
"And well-deserved, at that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I'll tell ya straight-up: I still enjoyed that. So\r\n"
"swing by any time ya feel like catchin' some random dude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid ""
"No shit, Sherlock. Can't make a living if my clock ain't\r\n"
"permanently set to hammertime. Can't catch this... or somethin' like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"Anyway, pro tip: Ya gotta figure out where I'm going ahead\r\n"
"of time or you'll never hope to catch me. And once I'm outta\r\n"
"sight, it's all over for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"But, that was still enjoyable. I'll be waitin' right here, so swing by any "
"time you want a rematch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "Ooh, lookie here. The big man wants himself another challenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "That's mighty fine, 'cause we're all rarin' to go. So what's it gonna be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "Let's see here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"You know what?\r\n"
"I'll take one of you on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid ""
"All right then, who's it gonna be? Er, how to put this...\r\n"
"You feel like hittin' someone annoying, runnin' from a\r\n"
"weirdo, or chasin' a guy down?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "Decisions, decisions..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "I'll take on Mr. Try and Hit Me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid ""
"Great! Very much looking forward to this! All it's gonna\r\n"
"cost is 3,000 yen. If you got the money, then do I got a\r\n"
"challenge for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "All right. Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid ""
"Sweet! Punch or kick me in a minute or less, and that\r\n"
"50,000 yen prize money's all yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid ""
"So... Ready to get started?\r\n"
"Then come on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "...Ah. Looks like I'm a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Man, that really kills the mood. I'm running a business here, dude!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid ""
"Well, go earn yourself 3,000 yen and I'll stay planted here.\r\n"
"It'll be a good challenge for the both of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid "Then I won't be long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "I'll take on Mr. Try and Flee Me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid ""
"Ooh, now this should be good. It'll cost you 5,000 yen\r\n"
"up front. You got that kind of money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "Yeah. Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid ""
"Okay, good. So. You run around the city while keeping away\r\n"
"from me. Do that long enough, you get 70,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
msgid ""
"Don't screw around either, or I'll catch you in a heartbeat!\r\n"
"Now let's get started!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid "...Ah. Looks like I'm a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1272"
msgid "...And here I am, getting all pumped up for nothing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid ""
"Go scrape up the 5,000 yen and come back later. I'll be\r\n"
"waiting right here till then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1296"
msgid "Then I'll be right back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid "I'll take on Mr. Try and Catch Me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid ""
"Now that's what I'm talkin' about. It'll cost ya 10,000 yen\r\n"
"up front. I take it that won't be an issue?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1392"
msgid "Fine by me. Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid ""
"Very good. I'm gonna be runnin' through the streets of\r\n"
"Kamurocho, and if ya catch me before time's up, I'll shell\r\n"
"out 100,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1416"
msgid "Don't let me down now... Ya ready? 'Cause here we go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1440"
msgid "...Ah. Looks like I'm a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1452"
msgid ""
"What're you, a fuckin' bum? You tell me this now, after building up all "
"that hype?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1464"
msgid "Fine.. Go scrape up 10,000 yen and come back. I'll be waitin' right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1476"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1536"
msgid "Sorry... Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1548"
msgid ""
"Well, guess we can't force ya. We'll be doin' our\r\n"
"usual business here, so swing by any time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1560"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1572"
msgid "See ya 'round, then."
msgstr ""

